// MARK: VSVulkanFunctions
/// The core's ready loaded Vulkan dispatch table, from `VSVulkan4.h`.
///
/// Every member is an `Option`: the header marks the debug utils entries
/// optional, so a null one must be checked at the call site rather than
/// called. The rest are core Vulkan 1.4 and are always present.
///
/// The member order is the header's, and the struct is one flat run of
/// pointers, so a filter built against a different header would silently
